{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C4\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"keep：清单明确为“无”，四者在指定保留项上没有可区分的差别，按候选原序列并列占位。cover：C4最好地把短暂柔软重新出现的原因落在他曾向往的、不必时时防备的生活上，同时交代了暂时喘息和安静终将退去；C1也有完整的因果链，但对过去生活的指向稍弱。lean：C2只有两个步骤，回到亲近、暂缓回答、安静短暂，推进紧凑；C4次之，C3的第一条和第二条对柔软与安宁有一定重复。plain：C1最像一个人在讲自己的经历，心软、记得满足、愿意多待一会儿、难题又会回来，都是直接的心理活动；C2也自然，但“还该不该继续争取”稍显概念化；C3的“审问自己”带有较强的修辞感。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a34e982e-e0e1-494c-8963-ea85360945a6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T233932584432Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:40:18.108517+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "595ff79f0889e968e0034dd72ba9546430f28758dae4ac9fc69c2a86534fbd96", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_